
## Important sites:

* parameter database: https://codes.ecmwf.int/grib/param-db/
* MARS user documentation: https://confluence.ecmwf.int/display/UDOC/MARS+user+documentation
* ECMWF web api
* Archive catalogue: https://confluence.ecmwf.int/display/WEBAPI/ECMWF+Web+API+Home
* ERA5 catalog: https://apps.ecmwf.int/data-catalogues/era5/?class=ea
* tuto: https://confluence.ecmwf.int/display/UDOC/HRES%3A+Atmospheric+%28oper%29%2C+Model+level+%28ml%29%2C+Forecast+%28fc%29%3A+Guidelines+to+write+efficient+MARS+requests

## Parameters needed for arome: 
* Atmosphere
    * param=130/138/155, # t, d, vo
    * param=133, # specific humidity
    * param=152, # LNSP
    * WIND U/v: 131, 132
* Surface: 
    * param=27/28/29/30/32/33/39/40/41/42/129/139/141/160/161/162/170/172/183/236,
